  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#main-content)\n\n![Microsoft Teams](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Microsoft-Teams-logo-B.png)\n\n# SignatureMicrosoft  TeamsRoom  ExperienceTours\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![Microsoft Solution partner Modern Work logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/msp-badge-2.jpg)\n\n### Immersive Collaboration\n\nExperience the immersive Microsoft front row setup virtually, or in person at an AVI-SPL office. See our video tours below or book a visit today!\n\n- **[Explore Chicago](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#chicago)**\n- **[Explore Dallas](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#dallas)**\n- **[Explore Denver](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#denver)**\n- **[Explore Detroit](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#detroit)**\n- **[Explore Houston](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#houston)**\n- **[Explore Kansas City](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#kansas)**\n- **[Explore Florida](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#florida)**\n- **[Explore Dublin](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#dublin)**\n\n![AVI-SPL Chicago Signature Microsoft Teams Room](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/AVI-SPL-Chicago.jpg)\n\n### AVI-SPL Chicago\n\n**150 N Martingale Rd.,**\n\n**Suite 1400**\n\n**Schaumburg, IL 60173**\n\nOur Chicago office is located just 20 minutes from O’Hare airport in Schaumberg, IL. The Signature Microsoft Teams Room offers plenty of natural light and can comfortably seat eight team members.\n\n- Lenovo Teams Room\n\n- Primeview 21:9 display\n\n- Q-SYS Control\n\n- Q-SYS NC Cameras\n\n- QSC Speakers\n\n- Sennheiser Team Connect Ceiling Microphone\n\n\n[Book a Tour](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact)\n\n#### Take a virtual tour in Chicago.\n\nClick, drag, and scroll to move around the room.\n\n![AVI-SPL Dallas](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/AVI-SPL-lewisville-010-2-1.png)\n\n### AVI-SPL Dallas\n\n**2701 E. State Highway 121,**\n\n**Suite 800**\n\n**Lewisville, TX 75056**\n\nOur Dallas office is just 15 minutes north of Dallas/Fort Worth International Airport, off State Highway 121. This Signature Microsoft Teams Room offers a vibrant space with a glass wall with privacy shades and seating for four.\n\n- 32:9 video wall\n- Crestron Flex CX100 Microsoft Teams Conferencing System\n- Jabra PanaCast 50 camera and soundbar\n- Huddly Canvas Whiteboard Camera\n- Salamander Arc Table for Microsoft Teams Front Row Experience\n- Crestron Table Box with inserts that include Power and USB charging, HDMI, Ethernet and USB for BYOD\n\n[Book a Tour](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact)\n\n#### Take a virtual tour in Dallas.\n\nClick, drag, and scroll to move around the room.\n\n![AVI-SPL Denver](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/AVI-SPL-Denver.png)\n\n### AVI-SPL Denver\n\n**8560 Upland Drive,**\n\n**Suite 500**\n\n**Englewood, CO 80112**\n\nOur Denver office in Englewood is located 35 miles southeast of downtown. Our Signature Microsoft Teams Room features plenty of natural light and seating for four team members.\n\n- 21:9 5K 105” display\n- Lenovo Intel Microsoft Teams Engine w/Touchscreen Controller\n- 2 Logitech table mics\n- Microsoft Front Row Signature furniture kit\n- Logitech Rally Bar Mini Videobar\n\n[Book a Tour](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact)\n\n#### Take a virtual tour in Denver.\n\nClick, drag, and scroll to move around the room.\n\nSignature Microsoft Teams Room - Denver - Matterport 3D Showcase\n\n## Presented by\n\nPowered by\n\n![Hybrid meeting in AVI-SPL Detroit Signature Microsoft Teams Room](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Microsoft-Teams-Rooms-Detroit.png)\n\n### AVI-SPL Detroit\n\n**47199 Cartier Drive**\n\n**Wixom, MI 48393**\n\nOur Wixom office serves the Detroit metro and surrounding area. The office features a Signature Microsoft Teams Room with a window wall that offers plenty of natural light and seating for four team members.\n\n- Jupiter Pana 21:9 ultra-wide 5K 105” display\n- Jabra Panacast 50 camera and soundbar\n- Crestron Flex Room System\n- Custom arc table\n\n[Book a Tour](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact)\n\n#### Visit us in Detroit\n\n![AVI-SPL Detroit Signature Microsoft Teams Room](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/AVI-SPL-Detroit-Signature-Microsoft-Teams-Room.png)\n\n![AVI-SPL Microsoft Teams Room Houston](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/AVI-SPL-Microsoft-Team-Room-Houston.png)\n\n### AVI-SPL Houston\n\n**24333 W Sam Houston Pkwy N,**\n\n**Suite 150**\n\n**Houston, TX 77043**\n\n**[(281) 902-3933](tel:12819023933)**\n\nTest out the experience at AVI-SPL Houston, located just 25 minutes Northwest of downtown. The Signature Microsoft Teams Room seats up to eight people and features:\n\n- Primeview 105” 5K Interactive LCD Ultra High-Def Display\n- Lenovo Integrated Computer System for Microsoft Teams\n- Sound Control Kit for Jabra Panacast\n- Salamander Conference Table\n\n[Book a Tour](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact)\n\n![People in a hybrid meeting in a Signature Microsoft Teams Room](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/AVI-SPL-Kansas-36.jpg)\n\n### AVI-SPL Kansas City\n\n**9401 Indian Creek Parkway, Suite 900**\n\n**Overland Park, KS 66210**\n\nTwenty-five minutes Southwest of downtown, AVI-SPL Kansas City teams support area businesses with deep UCC expertise. This location’s Signature Microsoft Teams Room is a vibrant environment with glass walls and privacy shades, and seats six.\n\n- Logitech Scribe whiteboard camera\n\n- Crestron DM Essentials video transmitters\n\n- Huddly L1 Cameras in a Huddly Crew system\n\n- Biamp TesiraForte X400 DSP with TCM-X microphones and Desono speakers\n\n- Crestron UC-Engine MTR PC\n\n- Primeview 105” 21:9 display\n\n\n[Book a Tour](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact)\n\n#### Visit us in Kansas City\n\n![AVI-SPL South Florida](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/AVI-SPL-South-Florida.png)\n\n### AVI-SPL South Florida\n\n**2501 SW 160th Avenue, Suite 500**\n\n**Miramar, FL 33027**\n\nOur South Florida office located in Miramar is just 20 miles from the Miami and Fort Lauderdale airports. The Signature Microsoft Teams Room offers plenty of natural light and seating for four team members.\n\n- Crestron Flex controller\n\n- Jupiter Pana 21:9 ultra-wide 5K 105” display\n\n- Jabra® PanaCast 50 Video Bar for Microsoft Teams® Room\n- Salamander Designs Credenza and Arc Table\n\n\n[Book a Tour](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact)\n\n#### Take a virtual tour in South Florida.\n\nClick, drag, and scroll to move around the room.\n\n![Dublin Customer Experience Centre](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/AVI-SPL-Office-Dublin.png)\n\n### AVI-SPL Dublin\n\n**Unit 30 Tallaght Business Centre, Whitestown Road**\n\n**Tallaght, Dublin 24, D24 EAA9**\n\nOur new [Dublin Customer Experience Centre](https://avispl.com/dublin-customer-experience-centre/ \"Original URL: https://avispl.com/dublin-customer-experience-centre/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\") is located to the southwest of Dublin City Centre. The Signature Microsoft Teams Room offers a high-end front row inclusive meeting experience with plenty of natural light and seating for four team members.\n\n- Crestron Flex Controller\n\n- Planar URW105 5K Ultra-Wide LCD Display\n\n- Jabra Panacast 50\n\n- Huddly IQ Content Camera for Whiteboarding\n\n- Custom Arc Table from Dublin-based Manufacturer\n\n\n[Book a Tour](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact)\n\n#### View a walkthrough of the Dublin Customer Experience Centre",
