li>Custom arc table</li>\n</ul>\n                </div>\n                        <a class=\"ui-btn ui-btn--secondary\" href=\"https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact\"><span>Book a Tour</span></a>                    </div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"content page-block\" role=\"region\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"body-content\">\n\t\t\t<h4>Visit us in Detroit</h4>\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/AVI-SPL-Detroit-Signature-Microsoft-Teams-Room.png\" alt=\"AVI-SPL Detroit Signature Microsoft Teams Room\">\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section id=\"houston\" class=\"image-text-new page-block image-text-new--sm image-text-new--r image-text-new--dark\" role=\"region\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__image image-text-new__image--grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__image__wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/AVI-SPL-Microsoft-Team-Room-Houston.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"AVI-SPL Microsoft Teams Room Houston\">\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__text\">\n                        \t<h3 class=\"h3\">AVI-SPL Houston</h3>\n                                    \t<div class=\"body-content\">\n                \t<p><strong>24333 W Sam Houston Pkwy N,</strong><br>\n<strong>Suite 150</strong><br>\n<strong>Houston, TX 77043</strong><br>\n<strong><a href=\"tel:12819023933\">(281) 902-3933</a><br>\n</strong><br>\nTest out the experience at AVI-SPL Houston, located just 25 minutes Northwest of downtown. The Signature Microsoft Teams Room seats up to eight people and features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Primeview 105” 5K Interactive LCD Ultra High-Def Display</li>\n<li>Lenovo Integrated Computer System for Microsoft Teams</li>\n<li>Sound Control Kit for Jabra Panacast</li>\n<li>Salamander Conference Table</li>\n</ul>\n                </div>\n                        <a class=\"ui-btn ui-btn--secondary\" href=\"https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact\"><span>Book a Tour</span></a>                    </div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"content page-block page-block--padding-no-bottom\" role=\"region\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"body-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section id=\"kansas\" class=\"image-text-new page-block image-text-new--sm image-text-new--r image-text-new--dark\" role=\"region\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__image image-text-new__image--grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__image__wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"950\" height=\"633\" src=\"https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/AVI-SPL-Kansas-36.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"People in a hybrid meeting in a Signature Microsoft Teams Room\">\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__text\">\n                        \t<h3 class=\"h3\">AVI-SPL Kansas City</h3>\n                                    \t<div class=\"body-content\">\n                \t<p><strong>9401 Indian Creek Parkway, Suite 900</strong><br>\n<strong>Overland Park, KS 66210</strong></p>\n<p>Twenty-five minutes Southwest of downtown, AVI-SPL Kansas City teams support area businesses with deep UCC expertise. This location’s Signature Microsoft Teams Room is a vibrant environment with glass walls and privacy shades, and seats six.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\">Logitech Scribe whiteboard camera</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\">Crestron DM Essentials video transmitters</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\">Huddly L1 Cameras in a Huddly Crew system</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\">Biamp TesiraForte X400 DSP with TCM-X microphones and Desono speakers</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\">Crestron UC-Engine MTR PC</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock\">Primeview 105” 21:9 display</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n                </div>\n                        <a class=\"ui-btn ui-btn--secondary\" href=\"https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact\"><span>Book a Tour</span></a>                    </div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"content page-block\" role=\"region\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"body-content\">\n\t\t\t<h4>Visit us in Kansas City</h4>\n<p><!-- Click, drag, and scroll to move around the room. --></p>\n<div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><div src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1144660061?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"dji_0559_stabilization_test_v1 (1440p)\" data-original-tag=\"iframe\"></div></div>\n<p></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section id=\"florida\" class=\"image-text-new page-block image-text-new--sm image-text-new--r image-text-new--dark\" role=\"region\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__image image-text-new__image--grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__image__wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"665\" src=\"https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/AVI-SPL-South-Florida.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"AVI-SPL South Florida\">\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"image-text-new__text\">\n                        \t<h3 class=\"h3\">AVI-SPL South Florida</h3>\n                                    \t<div class=\"body-content\">\n                \t<p><strong>2501 SW 160th Avenue, Suite 500</strong><br>\n<strong>Miramar, FL 33027</strong></p>\n<p>Our South Florida office located in Miramar is just 20 miles from the Miami and Fort Lauderdale airports. The Signature Microsoft Teams Room offers plenty of natural light and seating for four team members.</p>\n<ul class=\"RichTextList-bulleted\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--m RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph\">Crestron Flex controller</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--m RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph\">Jupiter Pana 21:9 ultra-wide 5K 105” display</div>\n</li>\n<li>Jabra® PanaCast 50 Video Bar for Microsoft Teams® Room</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--m RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph\">Salamander Designs Credenza and Arc Table</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n                </div>\n                        <a class=\"ui-btn ui-btn--secondary\" href=\"https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact\"><span>Book a Tour</span></a>                    </div>\n\t</div>\n</section>