--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph\">Crestron Flex Controller</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--m RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph\">Planar URW105 5K Ultra-Wide LCD Display</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--m RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph\">Jabra Panacast 50</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--m RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph\">Huddly IQ Content Camera for Whiteboarding</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--m RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph\">Custom Arc Table from Dublin-based Manufacturer</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n                </div>\n                        <a class=\"ui-btn ui-btn--secondary\" href=\"https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-room-experience-tours/#contact\"><span>Book a Tour</span></a>                    </div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"content page-block\" role=\"region\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"body-content\">\n\t\t\t<h4>View a walkthrough of the Dublin Customer Experience Centre</h4>\n<p><!-- Click, drag, and scroll to move around the room. --></p>\n<div style=\"padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" title=\"AVI-SPL_BrandAnthem-Updated\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1084635885?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" data-original-tag=\"iframe\"></div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\t\t\t</main>\n\n\n<div class=\"footer-pusher\" style=\"height: 1301.27px;\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; visibility: hidden;\" data-original-tag